{"id":"vod_bf_50625","vodId":"50625","provider":"bf","providerName":"暴风资源","type":2,"name":"来玩游戏吧 游戏3人娘","name_cn":"来玩游戏吧 游戏3人娘","date":"2018-01-01","year":"2018","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://img.bfzypic.com/upload/vod/20230724-1/94ee0c69a7cd2ee620d5f04eece8983a.jpg"},"summary":"奥莉薇（长江里加 配音）是学校里新来的转校生，金发碧眼的她生得一副标准的外国人面孔，但实际上，无论是出生和成长都在日本境内的她，根本就一丁点英语都不会说。野村香纯（小原好美 配音）拥有着过人的智商，在几乎全部的学科上都是头筹的位置，但偏偏对英语这门科目不感冒，不只是不感冒，香纯的英语成绩只能用惨不忍睹来形容。奥莉薇的出现让香纯看到了希望，她打算拜托对方帮自己补习英语。本田华子（木野日菜 配音）看上去有些呆呆的，常常会做出一些傻事，但成绩却意外的不错，对现充生活充满了憧憬的她，却同奥莉薇和香纯一起，被拉入了游戏的世界之中。©豆瓣","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2025-04-02 19:17:16","playable":true,"episodeCount":15,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"bfzym3u8","episodes":[{"name":"01","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf6.com/video/laiwanyouxibayouxi3renniang/01/index.m3u8"},{"name":"02","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf6.com/video/laiwanyouxibayouxi3renniang/02/index.m3u8"},{"name":"03","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf6.com/video/laiwanyouxibayouxi3renniang/03/index.m3u8"},{"name":"04","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf6.com/video/laiwanyouxibayouxi3renniang/04/index.m3u8"},{"name":"05","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf6.com/video/laiwanyouxibayouxi3renniang/05/index.m3u8"},{"name":"06","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf6.com/video/laiwanyouxibayouxi3renniang/06/index.m3u8"},{"name":"07","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf6.com/video/laiwanyouxibayouxi3renniang/07/index.m3u8"},{"name":"08","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf6.com/video/laiwanyouxibayouxi3renniang/08/index.m3u8"},{"name":"09","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf6.com/video/laiwanyouxibayouxi3renniang/09/index.m3u8"},{"name":"10","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf6.com/video/laiwanyouxibayouxi3renniang/10/index.m3u8"},{"name":"11","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf6.com/video/laiwanyouxibayouxi3renniang/11/index.m3u8"},{"name":"12","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf6.com/video/laiwanyouxibayouxi3renniang/12/index.m3u8"},{"name":"OAD[CHS]","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf6.com/video/laiwanyo